SUMMARY:Deadline: CUNY Law Pipeline to Justice
DESCRIPTION:LSAT and skills program for applicants from underrepresented co
 mmunities\, including those denied by CUNY Law.\nWhere and when: Evenings\
 , September–May\nWho: Needs an LSAT score from the past 5 years\; in per
 son only\, at CUNY Law in Long Island City\nCost: $60 application fee plus
  a one-time program fee (amount not posted)\, and you pay for the January 
 and February LSATs. No scholarships or aid\; finishing the program waives 
 CUNY Law's seat deposit if you enroll there\nOpens: Late winter\n\nDetails
 : https://maljahmi.github.io/qc-polisci-pathways/programs.html#lp-cuny-law
